              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaangwí a iigu'utuú Mungú aa laqán daanduú yaamaá Misriro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalaadae múk Misri tari da'ayumiit adór /ameena, tari kitlkiitl daeero as dakwduú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Aleesleemusmo aa gawaaíní tleés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamaá Yuda kiri da'ayuut nee yaamaá Misri, umuú heewo oo taa kángw yaamaá Yuda báy, in daanda feehhiit daeero, as tlehhmuwí AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Aleesleemusmo aa istí tsaát tleehhamooro daanduine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalaadae tsifrír Ebrania kanar axwees baraá gixsadaá kooán awa yaamaá Misriro, múk gixsaduudá' lo'o kari /aay dir AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Aleesleemusmoó wa alé, ar inooín kiwa inkihhím. Gixsár wák kari bay, «Gixsár Tsee/amá.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalaadae kitángw ilahhooa kawa hanmiis dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kuri tleehh baraá tla/ángw yaamaá Misri, nee uhmoó taa paraátl as AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kuri siihh baraá digeemaá yaamaá Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muruuwí tari laya nee lamabu'uungw dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Aleesleemusmoowo baraá yaamaá Misriro, qoomár birna amór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i /aa/iyé' as baramaanusmo, inós gin ba/amusmoówí ya/aaw, giri aleekalaa/, giri ba/amis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tiri xu'utis dír múk Misri. Nee múk Misri AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nguri xuiyá', nguri sluufmiisiyá' ar ilahhooár muruú ta tsu/i, nee ilahhooár da/a/ango, nee al'axweesani ngiri oiná' dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, ngiri boo/eesiyá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ xoorór Misri gan muux, inós birnga muúx gari huungu/umiis. Inooín niri ki/iyá' amór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, nee inós firor'ín gari axaas giri huungu/uus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalaadae loohír ur ni Misrír wa tleér ay Ashuru, múk Ashuru nee múk Misri tiri haraxaxayá'. Múk Misri nee oo Ashuru Mungú nguri dinkwár sluufmiisiyá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalaadae múk Israeli in haragwaa' dír múk Misri nee oo Ashuru, inooínaaká' tamaawo tsuuqa ngiri huwiyá' baraá yaamu sleémeerowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma inooín an kudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Aleesleemusmo aa tsuúq, iwa kaahi, «Muk'eé' oo Misri ku tsuuqi, dinkwa nee múk Ashuru kudá' dabaeene naa tleéhh, dinkwa nee múk Israeli kuduú aalir'eé'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
